title: Hamburg Rises Alone
subtitle: The courier from Chemnitz arrived too late.
new-page: true
tags: event
view-if: crisis_october = 1 and e23_rising_phase = 2 and e23_hamburg_done = 0
max-visits: 1
priority: 3
on-arrival: {!
if (!RG.e22) { this._runActions(this.game.scenes.e22_lib.onArrival); }
RG.news('Hamburg communists storm police stations in Barmbek', 3);
RG.district('hamburg', {repression: 20, militancy: 10});
Q.e23_hh_thal = Q.comrade_thalmann == 1 ? 1 : 0;
if (Q.e23_hh_thal) { RG.setRole('thalmann', 'Leader of the Hamburg rising'); }
Q.e23_hamburg_done = 1;
!}

= Hamburg Rises Alone

Before dawn on 23 October a few hundred armed communists storm the police stations of Barmbek, Schiffbek and Eimsbüttel. They take the rifles and build barricades of paving stones and overturned trams. They believe the whole Reich is rising with them.

The police recover within hours and marines arrive from Kiel. In Barmbek the fighters hold out while women carry food and ammunition through the courtyards, and the rest of the city goes to work. [? if e23_hh_thal = 1 : Ernst Thälmann sends to the Zentrale for orders. ?][? if e23_hh_thal = 0 : The Hamburg leaders send to the Zentrale for orders. ?]

- @retreat: Get the fighters out.
- @disown: Disown the rising.
- @signal: Make Hamburg the signal after all.

@retreat
subtitle: Saves lives and the Hamburg organisation.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.directive_active && Q.directive_id == 'october') { RG.directiveResolve('fail'); Q.directive_reckoning = 0; Q.e23_oct_verdict = 1; }
RG.district('hamburg', {guards: -Q.district_hamburg_guards * 0.5, members: -0.15, loyalty: 6});
RG.ecci('trotsky', -10);
if (Q.e23_hh_thal == 1) { RG.setRole('thalmann', 'Hamburg leader, in hiding'); }
RG.ledger('Hamburg rose alone, and the fighters of Barmbek got away.', 'e23_barmbek');
Q.german_october = 1;
Q.e23_oct_result = 0;
RG.e22.octClear();
!}

On the night of 25 October the last fighters slip away through the allotments with their rifles. Twenty-four of them are dead, and seventeen policemen.

@disown
subtitle: The Zentrale keeps its hands clean. Hamburg will not forgive it.
on-arrival: {!
if (Q.directive_active && Q.directive_id == 'october') { RG.directiveResolve('fail'); Q.directive_reckoning = 0; Q.e23_oct_verdict = 1; }
RG.district('hamburg', {guards: -Q.district_hamburg_guards * 0.7, members: -0.2, loyalty: -15});
RG.ecci('zinoviev', -10);
RG.ledger('Hamburg rose alone, and the Zentrale disowned it.', 'e23_barmbek');
if (Q.e23_hh_thal == 1) { RG.arrest('thalmann', 8, {news: 'Thälmann arrested in Hamburg'}); }
Q.german_october = 1;
Q.e23_oct_result = 0;
Q.unity -= 5;
RG.e22.octClear();
!}

[? if e23_hh_thal = 1 : Thälmann is taken in a raid on a Barmbek flat two days later. ?] *Die Rote Fahne* calls the rising a local action taken without the Zentrale's knowledge. The Hamburg police arrest everyone it names.

@signal
subtitle: [? if lock_uprising = 1 : Against the party line: costs Unity. ?] Two days late, with the enemy warned.
choose-if: lock_uprising < 2
unavailable-subtitle: The [+ leading_faction_adj +] line forbids an armed rising.
on-arrival: {!
RG.e22.against('uprising');
RG.ecci('bukharin', 6);
RG.news('Hamburg is the signal: the Reich rises', 3);
RG.e22.octRise(['hamburg', 'saxony', 'berlin'], 'The German Revolution', 'Win the rising that Hamburg began.', -4);
Q.lean_offensive += 3;
!}

The Zentrale reverses itself in a night session and the couriers go out again, this time with the signal. In Saxony, Thuringia and Berlin the hundreds dig up their rifles. Hamburg holds out for a third day.
